        "bank": ["had", "would", "work", "Provided", "motivated", "unless", "otherwise"]
      },
      "sentences": [
        "If I were rich I would travel the world.",
        "We would help if we could.",
        "If she studied more she would pass.",
        "I wouldn't do that unless necessary."
